  '0033': "A peaceful nature spirit found deep within an enchanted autumnal forest. A faun maiden with delicate horns and rustic lower legs sits gracefully on a mossy log, playing a tranquil melody on a wooden flute while a tattooed human companion rests his head against her lap, finding brief solace far away from the wars of the realm.",
  '0034': "A grotesque insectoid monstrosity native to overgrown forest trails, the Bloatspider guards its territory with violent malice. Armed with spiked chitinous armor, multiple eyes, and a gaping maw filled with dripping fangs, it bursts from the ferns, having just upended an unsuspecting traveler's mushroom basket.",
