  '0036': "A massive, blue-skinned frost giant roaming the high, blizzard-swept mountain peaks. Adorned with bone necklaces and heavy pelts, he roars in primal fury while gripping a massive club fashioned from a beast's femur, relentlessly chasing fleeing scouts through deep snowdrifts.",
  '0037': "An agile undead warrior of Kalthrone bursting out from a magical barrier of shattering blue ice. Clad in spiked iron armor with glowing cyan oculars, this frozen executioner leaps through a subterranean crypt, brandishing a wicked, double-bitted poleaxe to ambush any intruders.",
