  '0041': "A fierce and battle-hardened warrior woman of Elderveld, Thessa fights on the muddy frontline of a violent siege. Wearing a steel helmet with a flowing black crest and plate-reinforced armor, she grips a blood-stained battleaxe and a shield, holding her ground against opposing infantry.",
