  '0043': "A powerful and calculating noble sorceress of Ravaria, Katerina stands amidst the ancient, ivy-covered ruins of a stone fortress. Wearing an opulent crimson dress and a golden crown, she calmly commands a swarm of glowing green spirit-snakes that coil protectively around her.",
