  '0048': "A weathered and indomitable frontline sergeant of Elderveld, Drustan leads his men through a brutal, rain-soaked melee in the shadow of mountain peaks. Clad in dented steel armor and bearing a lion-crested shield, he screams a battle cry while raising a bloodied hand axe to strike down an enemy combatant.",
  '0049': "A legendary, high-ranking general of the Elarion Empire, Eldran stands proudly upon a snowy mountain precipice overlooking distant imperial spires. Clad in ornate, gold-engraved plate armor adorned with majestic stag antlers and holding a massive, finely-crafted broadsword, he embodies the unyielding majesty and strength of his empire.",
  '0050': "A majestic, ethereal leviathan drifting through the subterranean abyss of deep crystal caverns. Glowing with a soft celestial light and surrounded by floating stardust, this mystical entity glides silently over dark chasms and stalagmites as a lone traveler looks on in awe.",
  '0051': "A sadistic pyromancer and torturer within the Horde of the Carrion. With long dark hair and a cruel, scarred smirk, Tharic uses his blazing touch to immolate an enemy knight in full armor outside a burning fortress, taking sadistic pleasure in the chaos.",
  '0052': "The poised and elegant royal heir of Elderveld, resting within her castle hall. Adorned in a rich blue and white velvet gown, an ermine-trimmed crimson cloak, and a golden crown, she holds a jeweled scepter while an advisor's hand rests reassuringly upon her shoulder.",
  '0053': "A high knight-commander of Ravaria on a solemn patrol through a gloomy, twisted forest. Clad in dark, ornate plate armor with winged helm and a flowing crimson cape, he bears the realm's banner on horseback while keeping his broadsword ready for unseen threats.",
