  '0077': "A valiant knight-commander of Elderveld fighting on a stormy, wave-lashed coastal battlefield. Clad in gleaming steel armor and riding a warhorse, Eryc uses his runic broadsword to shatter the shell of a monstrous giant red crab while more of the crustacean horrors swarm from the surf.",
