  '0100': "A legendary, battle-hardened veteran commander of the Elderveld Empire. Clad in dented steel plate armor bearing the realm's griffin crest and a dark blue cloak, General Oren dual-wields two blood-stained swords amidst a raging, fire-choked battlefield, roaring with fierce defiance.",
