  '0104': "A skilled tournament champion of Ravaria charging through a sunlit forest clearing. Clad in polished steel plate armor with striking red-and-white accents and a matching plumed helm, he rides a powerful white warhorse, having just shattered his wooden lance against an opponent's shield.",
  '0105': "A cruel beast-master of the Horde of the Carrion, leading his pack through a dark, foggy woodland trail. Wearing a scarred, leather-strapped harness and a steel half-mask, he holds heavy chains attached to two vicious, spiked hounds whose maws glow with crackling purple energy.",
  '0106': "A grim vanguard soldier standing guard inside a stone fortress archway. Clad in chainmail, a leather jerkin, and a steel helmet, he grips a long poleaxe while a massive, roaring wall of fire burns intensely on the stone steps behind him.",
