  '0109': "A formidable dark sorcerer navigating the shattered ruins of a fallen city. Bald, cloaked in ragged dark fabrics, and carrying a crystal-topped wooden staff, he walks forward with an ominous aura as a towering, snarling specter of crackling blue flame looms directly behind him.",
  '0110': "A heroic standard-bearer and frontline knight of Ravaria, charging into battle on a caparisoned white steed. Clad in polished plate armor and a crimson cloak, she holds a large banner inscribed with \"Honor & Valor\" high in one hand and a gleaming sword in the other, racing beneath a dramatic sunset sky toward a distant mountaintop castle.",
  '0111': "A dedicated master archivist and scholar studying within a vast, multi-tiered library. Wearing a blue scholarly robe and academic cap, he sits at a heavy wooden desk illuminated by an oil lamp, carefully penning historical records into a large tome surrounded by reference texts like Codex Alchymica and Historia.",
